Rohan shows me my new space.
"Maya, this is your space," Rohan says.
I look at the desk.
The desk is very big and clean.
There is a monitor, a keyboard, and a mouse on the desk.
"I have a very big monitor," I say happily.
Rohan smiles.
"Do you have a laptop?" he asks.
"Yes, I have my laptop," I answer.
I put my bag on the desk.
I take the laptop out of the bag.
"Thank you, Rohan," I say.
"Do you need any help?" he asks.
"No, everything is fine now," I say.
Rohan goes to his desk.
I sit on my new chair.
This chair is very comfortable.
I like my new space a lot.
I start my daily work.
